# Sneak {W} (CR 702.190a-b): Bot1 attacks with Ornithopter on turn 3 and nobody blocks; in the declare blockers step it casts
# Leonardo, Big Brother for {W}, returning the Ornithopter to its hand. He enters tapped and attacking Bot2 and, with Action
# News Crew the one other creature Bot1 controls (the returned Ornithopter is no longer one), is 2/3 and deals 2: Bot2 at 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl x2
Ornithopter
Action News Crew
Leonardo, Big Brother
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Action News Crew.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Hand.Leonardo, Big Brother.Cast(Ability: Sneak)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
? Stack = Leonardo, Big Brother
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Combat.Attackers = Leonardo, Big Brother > Bot2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Leonardo, Big Brother.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Leonardo, Big Brother.Power = 2
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Leonardo, Big Brother.Power = 2
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
